Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Knowledge Base|
	And these variables
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Knowledge Base|
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Article Page|
		|portletName|Knowledge Base Article|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|${pageName}|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|1 Column|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|${portletName}|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Delete KB Article Via KB Article
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Article Page|
	And KBArticle select PG Via KB Article
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Article Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Article Page|
	And KBArticle view PG
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And KBArticle delete PG
		|deleteViaKBArticle|true|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	Then KBArticle view Default CP

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
